  "description": "Turns Hlibz.Results errors into MCP tool errors a model can act on: a tool unwraps its result with ValueOrThrow(), and a failed call comes back as isError with guidance (what to do next, in terms of your tools, its {placeholders} filled from the error's data) as text, and { code, details } as structured content. Each tool lists the errors it can return, declared with [ToolErrors<TErrorSet>] or worked out by your own IToolErrorSource, in its _meta under \"hlibz/errors\", which Hlibz.McpDocs.AspNetCore shows on its docs page. The server doesn't start while a tool's error has no guidance.",
